576 0 obj
<<
/Title (The study showed that low-code is growing from a quick way to build simple apps into a wider field where visual building, pro-code extension and AI work side by side. The platform landscape is broad, and skills learned on one platform, such as Zoho Creator, carry over to others.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 495 0 R
/Next 670 0 R
>>
endobj
577 0 obj
<<
/Title (The main risks are shadow IT, security gaps, the quality of AI-generated output and lock-in, and they are managed through governance and human review. The exercise met its objective, and the presentation outline is ready to be turned into slides. The conclusions rest on general industry knowledge, so any trend or statistic should be checked against current original sources before use.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 495 0 R
/Prev 670 0 R
>>
endobj
