/Title (To study the career paths open to low-code developers and the direction low-code development is likely to take across the industry, looking at low-code and no-code platforms in general rather than one product. The study ends with a report and a presentation outline that link these trends to the skills practised in the course experiments, including the Bank Loan Application Form.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 568 0 R
/Next 657 0 R
>>
